PortLogisticsContext *-- StorageAreaDataModel : manages
StorageAreaDataModel *-- "0..*" StorageAreaServedDockDataModel : has

note right of StorageArea
  **Aggregate Root**
  Enforces business rules:
  - Identifier unique & required
  - Type: Yard or Warehouse
  - MaxCapacity >= CurrentOccupancy
  - CurrentOccupancy >= 0
  - ServedDocks optional (default: serves all)
  - Distance > 0
end note

note right of StorageAreaService
  **Application Service**
  Orchestrates:
  - Identifier uniqueness check
  - Capacity validation
  - Domain validation
  - Persistence operations
  - DTO mapping
end note

